{"type":"uit-contribution","plugin":"Sceneweaver","kinds":["free"],"entries":[{"Original":"DISCOVER GAME ASSETS","Translated":"发现 GAME ASSETS","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextColored"},{"Original":" indexed resources","Translated":"索引资源","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Loading catalog...","Translated":"加载目录...","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Select to inspect. Add to your scene only when you choose.","Translated":"选择以检查。仅在您选择时添加到场景。","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Search name or path — e.g. gyr tree, bgparts, furniture","Translated":"搜索名称或路径——例如 gyr tree、bgparts、家具","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.InputTextWithHint"},{"Original":"Catalog could not load: ","Translated":"目录无法加载：","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Folders","Translated":"文件夹","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TableSetupColumn"},{"Original":"Assets","Translated":"资产","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TableSetupColumn"},{"Original":"Preview","Translated":"预览","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TableSetupColumn"},{"Original":"GAME FOLDERS","Translated":"游戏文件夹","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"All game assets","Translated":"所有游戏资源","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Selectable"},{"Original":"< Parent folder","Translated":"<父文件夹","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Environment / zones","Translated":"环境/区域","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Selectable"},{"Original":"Shared props / housing","Translated":"共享道具/住房","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Selectable"},{"Original":"Characters / equipment","Translated":"角色/设备","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Selectable"},{"Original":"Visual effects","Translated":"视觉效果","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Selectable"},{"Original":"Sounds","Translated":"声音","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Selectable"},{"Original":"These are indexed game paths, independent of the objects in your room. Some catalog entries may be absent in your installed game version.","Translated":"这些是索引游戏路径，与你房间里的物品无关。在你安装的游戏版本中，一些目录条目可能不存在。","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":" results","Translated":"结果","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"No matching assets. Try a shorter search, another type, or All game assets.","Translated":"无匹配资源。尝试更短的搜索、其他类型或所有游戏资源。","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"ISOLATED PREVIEW","Translated":"孤立预览","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Choose an asset from the list to inspect it here.","Translated":"从列表中选择一个资产，在此处查看。","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Large models are automatically fitted to this panel. Browsing never places objects in your room.","Translated":"大型模型会自动安装在这个面板上。浏览永远不会将物品放置在房间里。","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Drag to orbit  |  Wheel to zoom","Translated":"拖动到轨道 | 滚轮缩放","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Fit model","Translated":"适合的模型","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Base-color textures with preview lighting. Special shaders and animation may look different in game.","Translated":"带预览灯光的基色纹理。特殊着色器和动画在游戏中可能看起来不同。","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Sound resource. Audio preview is not available; no sound is played.","Translated":"声音资源。音频预览不可用;没有声音播放。","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"This effect is indexed and can be added, but animated VFX cannot yet be rendered in this panel. No effect is spawned.","Translated":"此效果已编制索引并可添加，但动画视觉特效尚不能在此面板中渲染。不会产生任何效果。","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Add to scene","Translated":"添加到场景","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Place in game at my character","Translated":"将我的角色置于游戏中","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Save favorite","Translated":"保存最喜欢的","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Saved to favorites","Translated":"保存到收藏夹","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"GAME PATH","Translated":"游戏路径","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Copy path","Translated":"复制路径","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Stagehand only: Intoner has no sound object type. Export will report this.","Translated":"仅限后台:Intoner 没有声音对象类型。导出将报告此情况。","Context":"Plugin.DrawAssets","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Browser locations reset: ","Translated":"重置浏览器位置：","Context":"Plugin.InitializeLocations","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Ready to open ","Translated":"准备打开","Context":"Plugin.ImportFile","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":" objects). Choose whether to discard your unsaved changes below.","Translated":"对象。选择是否在下方丢弃未保存的更改。","Context":"Plugin.ImportFile","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Open Stagehand...","Translated":"打开舞台助手...","Context":"Plugin.DrawImportButtons","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Open Intoner...","Translated":"打开 Intoner...","Context":"Plugin.DrawImportButtons","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Open project...","Translated":"开放项目......","Context":"Plugin.DrawImportButtons","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Windows file picker is open...","Translated":"Windows 文件选取器已打开...","Context":"Plugin.DrawImportButtons","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Browse...","Translated":"浏览...","Context":"Plugin.Destination","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Ambient lights do not project textures. The saved texture is retained if you change the shape back.","Translated":"环境光不会投射纹理。如果您将形状改回去，保留的纹理会被保留。","Context":"Plugin.DrawLightTexture","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Projected texture (.tex)","Translated":"投射纹理 (.tex)","Context":"Plugin.DrawLightTexture","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.InputText"},{"Original":"Spot and flat lights require a 2D texture.","Translated":"聚光灯和平面灯需要 2D 纹理。","Context":"Plugin.DrawLightTexture","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Point lights require a cubemap texture.","Translated":"点灯需要立方体贴图纹理。","Context":"Plugin.DrawLightTexture","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Press Enter to apply a path. See the projection using Show scene here.","Translated":"按回车键应用路径。请在此处使用 “显示场景” 查看投影。","Context":"Plugin.DrawLightTexture","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Use game example","Translated":"使用游戏示例","Context":"Plugin.DrawLightTexture","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Clear texture","Translated":"清晰的纹理","Context":"Plugin.DrawLightTexture","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Texture modpack","Translated":"Texture Modpack","Context":"Plugin.DrawLightTexture","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.BeginCombo"},{"Original":"Mod texture","Translated":"Mod texture 纹理","Context":"Plugin.DrawLightTexture","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.BeginCombo"},{"Original":"Choose a texture from this modpack","Translated":"从这个调制包中选择纹理","Context":"Plugin.DrawLightTexture","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.BeginCombo"},{"Original":"Import a Penumbra mod in Mods first to select its textures here. Projected textures are saved to Stagehand; Intoner exports keep the light without its projection.","Translated":"首先在 Mods 中导入一个 Penumbra 模块，在此选择其纹理。投影纹理会保存到 Stagehand;Intoner 输出会保留光线而不会投射。","Context":"Plugin.DrawLightTexture","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Added to the editor scene.","Translated":"添加到编辑场景中。","Context":"Plugin.AddSceneAsset","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Added at your character's position. Adjust its transform in Scene.","Translated":"添加到角色位置。在场景中调整其变换。","Context":"Plugin.AddSceneAsset","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Show scene here","Translated":"在此显示场景","Context":"Plugin.DrawLiveControls","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Moves the scene's saved stage placement so the selected object's origin is at your character. Live display uses Stagehand.","Translated":"移动场景中保存的舞台位置，使所选对象的原点位于您的角色中。实时显示使用舞台手。","Context":"Plugin.DrawLiveControls","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SetTooltip"},{"Original":"Show saved placement","Translated":"显示保存的场景布局","Context":"Plugin.DrawLiveControls","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Hide in game","Translated":"在游戏中隐藏","Context":"Plugin.DrawLiveControls","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Retry hiding scene","Translated":"重试隐藏场景","Context":"Plugin.DrawLiveControls","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Live display details","Translated":"实时显示详情","Context":"Plugin.DrawLiveControls","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TreeNode"},{"Original":"MOD LIBRARY","Translated":"MOD 资源库","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextColored"},{"Original":"Import a Penumbra .pmp or choose meta.json in an installed mod folder. Its selected files are embedded in the project and Stagehand export.","Translated":"导入 Penumbra .pmp 或在已安装的 mod 文件夹中选择 meta.json。其所选文件将嵌入项目和 Stagehand 导出中。","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Import mod...","Translated":"导入 mod...","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Reading mod files...","Translated":"阅读 mod 文件......","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Updating this project's mod. Matching resources will be replaced and removed resources dropped; object links remain unchanged. Review your option choices.","Translated":"更新本项目的模式。匹配的资源将被替换，删除的资源将被删除;对象链接保持不变。查看您的选项选择。","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"No selectable options; use the mod's default files.","Translated":"没有可选选项;使用模块的默认文件。","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Prepare selected files","Translated":"准备选定的文件","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Cancel import","Translated":"取消导入","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":" resources, ","Translated":"资源，","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":" models / effects / sounds. Materials and textures are included.","Translated":"模型/效果/声音。包含材质和纹理。","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":" previous resource paths will be removed; ","Translated":"先前的资源路径将被删除;","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":" scene objects use those paths and may revert to the game asset.","Translated":"场景对象使用这些路径，可能会恢复为游戏资产。","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Apply reviewed mod update","Translated":"应用已审核的模式更新","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Add mod to this project","Translated":"向这个项目添加 mod","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"No mods in this project. Modpacks from opened Stagehand saves also appear here.","Translated":"这个项目中没有 Mod 包。来自打开的 Stagehand 保存的 Mod 包也显示在这里。","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Project mod","Translated":"项目 mod","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.BeginCombo"},{"Original":"Source: ","Translated":"来源：","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"  Version: ","Translated":"版本：","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"unknown","Translated":"未知","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Update from installed Penumbra mod","Translated":"从已安装的 Penumera 模式更新","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Update from package / folder...","Translated":"包裹/文件夹更新......","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Apply mod to selected scene object","Translated":"将模式应用于所选场景对象","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Select an object in Scene first","Translated":"首先在场景中选择对象","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Stagehand export keeps these bindings. Intoner export omits mod-bound assets; lights export without projected textures. VFX can be previewed temporarily in game.","Translated":"手动导出保留这些绑定。音调导出省略调制绑定的资源;灯光导出没有投影纹理。视觉特效可以在游戏中临时预览。","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Search this mod's resource paths","Translated":"搜索此模式的资源路径","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.InputTextWithHint"},{"Original":"Resources","Translated":"资源","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TableSetupColumn"},{"Original":" placeable resources / ","Translated":"可放置资源/","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":" total files","Translated":"总文件","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Showing 500 results. Narrow the search to see others.","Translated":"显示 500 个结果。缩小搜索范围查看其他结果。","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"No matching model, effect or sound. For texture-only mods, select a Scene object and apply this mod above.","Translated":"无匹配模型、效果或声音。对于仅纹理模式，选择 Scene 对象并应用上述模式。","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Add mod asset to scene","Translated":"将 mod 资产添加到场景中","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Select a resource to inspect it. Previewing does not spawn it in the room.","Translated":"选择一个资源进行检查。预览不会在房间里产生它。","Context":"Plugin.DrawMods","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Browse installed Penumbra mods / Refresh","Translated":"浏览已安装的模块编