ne. Multiple stages.","Translated":"一个场景。多个阶段。","Context":"Plugin.Draw","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Sceneweaver could not complete the action","Translated":"场景编织器无法完成动作","Context":"Plugin.Draw","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.OpenPopup"},{"Original":"Unknown error.","Translated":"未知错误。","Context":"Plugin.Draw","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Close","Translated":"接近","Context":"Plugin.Draw","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"New","Translated":"新增","Context":"Plugin.Draw","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Undo","Translated":"撤销","Context":"Plugin.Draw","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":" objects  /  ","Translated":"对象 /","Context":"Plugin.Draw","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"No unsaved changes","Translated":"没有未保存的更改","Context":"Plugin.Draw","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Unsaved changes","Translated":"未保存的变更","Context":"Plugin.Draw","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"This will replace your unsaved scene. Save it first or discard the changes below.","Translated":"这将替换你未保存的场景。先保存它，或者丢弃下面的更改。","Context":"Plugin.Draw","Source":"ai:caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Discard changes and continue","Translated":"放弃更改并继续","Context":"Plugin.Draw","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Keep editing","Translated":"继续编辑","Context":"Plugin.Draw","Source":"ai:caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Discover assets","Translated":"发现资产","Context":"Plugin.Draw","Source":"ai:caiyun"